WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.269
Tuck Notch

00:00:01.317 --> 00:00:02.779
a free open-source

00:00:02.591 --> 00:00:03.699
macOS app

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.963
ASV Labs open-sourced

00:00:05.775 --> 00:00:06.612
Tuck Notch

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:07.649
a native notch

00:00:07.461 --> 00:00:08.675
app where scripts

00:00:08.805 --> 00:00:10.020
CI jobs and

00:00:09.879 --> 00:00:11.175
AI agents can

00:00:10.987 --> 00:00:12.508
publish status updates

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.829
and interactive alerts

00:00:14.018 --> 00:00:15.291
alongside music

00:00:15.338 --> 00:00:17.248
meetings weather clipboard

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.593
history and system

00:00:18.405 --> 00:00:19.182
monitoring

00:00:19.702 --> 00:00:21.364
The Apache 2.0

00:00:21.176 --> 00:00:22.202
app is signed

00:00:22.013 --> 00:00:22.956
and notarized

00:00:23.098 --> 00:00:24.360
updates itself and

00:00:24.171 --> 00:00:25.397
has no accounts

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.918
analytics or tracking

00:00:27.446 --> 00:00:28.861
The roadmap includes

00:00:28.672 --> 00:00:29.816
deeper Claude Code

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:30.936
progress integration

00:00:31.149 --> 00:00:32.693
AirPods battery monitoring

00:00:32.847 --> 00:00:33.979
a camera mirror

00:00:33.955 --> 00:00:35.806
a teleprompter gestures

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:37.328
and multi-display support

00:00:37.854 --> 00:00:38.868
Full story on

00:00:38.679 --> 00:00:39.575
the dashboard
